  "releaseNotes": "Vali-Range v1.1.0 — add Subtract for set-theoretic range difference. Add net10.0 target. No breaking changes.\n\n            Vali-Range v1.0.0 — initial release: DateRange struct, ValiRange class with Create, Contains, Overlaps, Intersection, Union, Expand, Shrink, Shift, EachDay, EachWeek, EachMonth, SplitByMonth, SplitByQuarter, and calendar-period helpers (ThisMonth, ThisWeek, ThisQuarter, ThisYear).",
